#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_REMOVE_MODEL.querybox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_REMOVE_MODEL.querybox.text
msgid ""
"Deleting the model '$MODELNAME' affects all controls currently bound to this "
"model.\n"
"Do you really want to delete this model?"
msgstr ""
"ምሳሌውን ማጥፋት '$MODELNAME' ሁሉንም መቆጣጠሪያዎች ከዚህ ምሳሌ ጋር የሚገናኙትን ተጽዕኖ ይፈጥርባቸዋል:\n"
"በእርግጥ ምሳሌውን ማጥፋት ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_REMOVE_INSTANCE.querybox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_REMOVE_INSTANCE.querybox.text
msgid ""
"Deleting the instance '$INSTANCENAME' affects all controls currently bound "
"to this instance.\n"
"Do you really want to delete this instance?"
msgstr ""
"ምሳሌውን ማጥፋት '$INSTANCENAME' ሁሉንም መቆጣጠሪያዎች ከዚህ ምሳሌ ጋር የሚገናኙትን ተጽዕኖ ይፈጥርባቸዋል:\n"
"በእርግጥ ምሳሌውን ማጥፋት ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_REMOVE_ELEMENT.querybox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_REMOVE_ELEMENT.querybox.text
msgid ""
"Deleting the element '$ELEMENTNAME' affects all controls currently bound to "
"this element.\n"
"Do you really want to delete this element?"
msgstr ""
"አካሉን ማጥፋት '$ELEMENTNAME' ሁሉንም መቆጣጠሪያዎች ከዚህ አካል ጋር የሚገናኙትን ተጽዕኖ ይፈጥርባቸዋል:\n"
"በእርግጥ አካሉን ማጥፋት ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_REMOVE_ATTRIBUTE.querybox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_REMOVE_ATTRIBUTE.querybox.text
msgid "Do you really want to delete the attribute '$ATTRIBUTENAME'?"
msgstr "ባህሪውን ማጥፋት ይፈልጋሉ '$ATTRIBUTENAME'?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_REMOVE_SUBMISSION.querybox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_REMOVE_SUBMISSION.querybox.text
msgid ""
"Deleting the submission '$SUBMISSIONNAME' affects all controls currently "
"bound to this submission.\n"
"\n"
"Do you really want to delete this submission?"
msgstr ""
"ማስገቢያውን ማጥፋት '$SUBMISSIONNAME' ሁሉንም መቆጣጠሪያዎች ከዚህ ማስገቢያ ጋር የሚገናኙትን ተጽዕኖ "
"ይፈጥርባቸዋል:\n"
"\n"
"በእርግጥ ማስገቢያውን ማጥፋት ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_REMOVE_BINDING.querybox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_REMOVE_BINDING.querybox.text
msgid ""
"Deleting the binding '$BINDINGNAME' affects all controls currently bound to "
"this binding.\n"
"\n"
"Do you really want to delete this binding?"
msgstr ""
"ማጣመሪያውን ማጥፋት '$BINDINGNAME' ሁሉንም መቆጣጠሪያዎች ከዚህ ማጣመሪያ ጋር የሚገናኙትን ተጽዕኖ ይፈጥርባቸዋል:"
"\n"
"\n"
"በእርግጥ ማጣመሪያውን ማጥፋት ይፈልጋሉ?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_QRY_LINK_WARNING.messbox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_QRY_LINK_WARNING.messbox.text
msgid ""
"This instance is linked with the form.\n"
"\n"
"The changes you make to this instance will be lost when the form is reloaded."
"\n"
"\n"
"How do you want to proceed?"
msgstr ""
"ይህ ምሳሌ ከ ፎርሙ ጋር የተገናኘ ነው:\n"
"\n"
"በዚህ ምሳሌ ላይ የሚያደርጉት ለውጥ በሙሉ ይጠፋል ፎርሙ እንደገና በሚጫንበት ጊዜ \n"
"\n"
"እንዴት ነው መቀጠል የሚፈልጉት?"

#: datanavi.src#RID_ERR_INVALID_XMLNAME.errorbox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_ERR_INVALID_XMLNAME.errorbox.text
msgid "The name '%1' is not valid in XML. Please enter a different name."
msgstr "ስሙ '%1' ዋጋ የለውም በ XML አይደለም: እባክዎን ሌላ የተለየ ስም ያስገቡ"

#: datanavi.src#RID_ERR_INVALID_XMLPREFIX.errorbox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_ERR_INVALID_XMLPREFIX.errorbox.text
msgid "The prefix '%1' is not valid in XML. Please enter a different prefix."
msgstr "መነሻው '%1' ዋጋ የለውም በ XML. እባክዎን የተለየ መነሻ ያስገቡ"

#: datanavi.src#RID_ERR_DOUBLE_MODELNAME.errorbox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_ERR_DOUBLE_MODELNAME.errorbox.text
msgid "The name '%1' already exists. Please enter a new name."
msgstr "ስሙ '%1' ቀደም ሲል ነበር: እባክዎን ሌላ አዲስ ስም ያስገቡ"

#: datanavi.src#RID_ERR_EMPTY_SUBMISSIONNAME.errorbox.text
#: datanavi.src%23RID_ERR_EMPTY_SUBMISSIONNAME.errorbox.text
msgid "The submission must have a name."
msgstr "ማስገቢያ ስም ያስፈልገዋል"

